- provide :title, "Gallery"
h1.mb-8.text-2xl.font-bold Gallery
/ Columns rather than a cropped grid: artworks keep their proportions, and the watermark
/ in their south-east corner stays visible.
ul class="columns-2 gap-2 sm:columns-3"
  - @artworks.each do |artwork|
    li.mb-2.break-inside-avoid
      = link_to url_for(artwork.image.variant(:gallery)) do
        = image_tag url_for(artwork.image.variant(:gallery_thumb)), alt: File.basename(artwork.filename, ".*"), loading: "lazy", class: "w-full rounded"
